      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Storage\n- userId(partition key)\n- appId (GSI)\n- operation: used | released\n- size\n- timestamp#Id (sort key)\n- ID //idempotent key written by app\n\n\nStorageMetadata\n- userId (PK)\n- availableStorage\n- overBudget\n- budget\n- appUsage {gmail:+5mb, photos:+5mb}\n- version (optimistic concurrency) \n- lastAppliedOffset\n\nUser \n- id, name, email",
