      "text": "- 1s batching for \nupdating\navailableStorage",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 1s batching for \nupdating\navailableStorage",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WHYlqcPq_A78lfCJTPgaT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1245.4171829223633,
      "y": 436.94140625,
      "width": 268.58001708984375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1643629405,
      "version": 278,
      "versionNonce": 1334982333,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793923984437,
      "created": 1793923912073,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-  1s batched simple writes \nwith no consolidation",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-  1s batched simple writes \nwith no consolidation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rSAK-H608a3Oi6H_1yemf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1173.22265625,
      "y": 974.9453125,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 395096925,
      "version": 1083,
      "versionNonce": 1850399059,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793925436244,
      "created": 1793924256842,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Read Path: \n- Given the availableStorage value is not up to date,\nwe can use that same eventual consistency budget\nfor the read operation with TTL of 1s\n- Another path, is to send push notifications for key events, like 'over-budget'\nwhen the budget exceeds for the userId\n- Storage-Read server can consume the Kafka partition based on the user\nconnected to its server, and listen for any events being published\n- The consumer 2 who's batching every 1s and updating the availableStorage on\nStorageMetadata can also now publish on Kafka topic\n- This way the apps can get a push notification for any key updates like 'over-\nbudget'\n- The reason for choosing Kafka for the return path instead of redis pub-sub,\nbecause Redis is fire and forget, and delivers at most once. Where as Kafaka\nallows replaying the vents incase of a server crash.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Read Path: \n- Given the availableStorage value is not up to date,\nwe can use that same eventual consistency budget\nfor the read operation with TTL of 1s\n- Another path, is to send push notifications for key events, like 'over-budget' when the budget exceeds for the userId\n- Storage-Read server can consume the Kafka partition based on the user  connected to its server, and listen for any events being published\n- The consumer 2 who's batching every 1s and updating the availableStorage on StorageMetadata can also now publish on Kafka topic\n- This way the apps can get a push notification for any key updates like 'over-budget'\n- The reason for choosing Kafka for the return path instead of redis pub-sub, because Redis is fire and forget, and delivers at most once. Where as Kafaka allows replaying the vents incase of a server crash.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
